Table full name: isb-cgc.GDC_metadata.rel18_fileData_active
Column name: dbName Type: STRING Description: Referring to the default/main database at the GDC. In this table, this field is always current.
Column name: file_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: Unique GDC identifier for this file (corresponds to the file_barcode)  --  this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal like this: https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/files/c21b332c-06c6-4403-9032-f91c8f407ba4
Column name: access Type: STRING Description: Data accessibility policy (open or controlled)
Column name: acl Type: STRING Description: Access Control List -- if access is controlled, this field contains the dbGaP accession, eg phs000179
Column name: analysis_input_file_gdc_ids Type: STRING Description: GDC file UUIDs for input file(s)
Column name: analysis_workflow_link Type: STRING Description: Link to GDC workflow on github
Column name: analysis_workflow_type Type: STRING Description: Workflow name eg  STAR 2-Pass  
Column name: archive_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: GDC archive UUID
Column name: archive_revision Type: INT64 Description: Archive revision number
Column name: archive_state Type: STRING Description: Archive state
Column name: archive_submitter_id Type: STRING Description: Original archive submitter name, eg  nationwidechildrens.org_BRCA.bio.Level_1.56
Column name: associated_entities__case_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: GDC case uuid for associated case(s)
Column name: associated_entities__entity_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: GDC entity uuid for associated entity(ies)
Column name: associated_entities__entity_submitter_id Type: STRING Description: Submitter id for associated entity(ies)
Column name: associated_entities__entity_type Type: STRING Description: Associated entity type, eg   aliquot   or   case  
Column name: case_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: GDC unique identifier
Column name: project_dbgap_accession_number Type: STRING Description: Program dbGaP accession number, eg phs000188
Column name: project_disease_type Type: STRING Description: The type of disease studied by the project; eg. Sarcoma,  Breast Invasive Carcinoma,Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia, etc
Column name: project_name Type: STRING Description: Project Name; frequently the same as or similar to the project disease type eg   Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia - Phase II   or   Breast Invasive Carcinoma   etc
Column name: program_dbgap_accession_number Type: STRING Description: Program dbGaP accession number, eg phs000178
Column name: program_name Type: STRING Description: Program name, eg TCGA or TARGET
Column name: project_short_name Type: STRING Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; eg. TCGA-OV, etc.
Column name: created_datetime Type: STRING Description: Timestamp of creation, eg 2016-10-27T21:58:12.297090-05:10
Column name: data_category Type: STRING Description: Category description of the underlying data, eg Clinical, Raw Sequencing Data, Simple Nucleotide Variation, Transcriptome Profiling  , etc
Column name: data_format Type: STRING Description: File format of the underlying data, eg BCR XML, BAM
Column name: data_type Type: STRING Description: Experimental source of the data type, eg Tissue slide image, RNA-Seq
Column name: downstream_analyses__output_file_gdc_ids Type: STRING Description: Semicolon-separated list of GDC file UUIDs
Column name: downstream_analyses__workflow_link Type: STRING Description: Name of GDC workflow, eg VarScan2 Annotation (if applicable, NULL where no information is available)
Column name: downstream_analyses__workflow_type Type: STRING Description: Name of GDC workflow, eg VarScan2 Annotation (if applicable, NULL where no information is available)
Column name: experimental_strategy Type: STRING Description: Experimental strategy used to generate data (where applicable) e.g. WXS, RNA-Seq
Column name: file_name Type: STRING Description: Name of file at the GDC
Column name: file_size Type: INT64 Description: The size of the file measured in bytes
Column name: file_id Type: STRING Description: GDC file identifier. This is a duplicate of file_gdc_id field found in some tables. 
Column name: index_file_gdc_id Type: STRING Description: Where available, GDC file uuid for index file 
Column name: index_file_name Type: STRING Description: Where available, GDC file name for index file 
Column name: index_file_size Type: INT64 Description: Where available, size of the index file in bytes 
Column name: md5sum Type: STRING Description: Md5sum for GDC data file
