Column name: file_type Type: STRING Description: File Type  -- eg aligned_reads, simple_somatic_mutation, gene_expression, etc
Column name: updated_datetime Type: STRING Description: Timestamp of latest update, eg 2017-03-04T16:37:26.081298-06:00
