Table full name: isb-cgc.GDC_metadata.GDC_sync_active_20190104
Column name: id Type: STRING Description: File UUID
Column name: project_id Type: STRING Description: Id of the Project -- e.g. eg TCGA-BRCA, TARGET-AML, etc
Column name: file_name Type: STRING Description: Name of file at the GDC
Column name: md5 Type: STRING Description: 128-bit hash value expressed as a 32 digit hexadecimal number (in lower case) used as a file's digital fingerprint
